{"slot":"what_settles_it","text":"A declared pass-rate line, and a look at what the urgent check expects on the failing cases."},
{"slot":"next","text":"Declare the line and the control, then re-run. See the next steps."}
],
"claims":[
{"id":"c1","text":"The triage arm passes {measure.passed.triage.mean} of trials, below its label accuracy of {measure.accuracy.triage.mean}.","weight":"lead","evidence":[{"block":"table","query":{"source":"measures","aspect":"","measures":["passed","accuracy","urgent"],"arms":[],"strata":[],"limit":0,"transform":"none","small_multiples_by":"none"},"caption":"Pass rate, label accuracy and urgent score for the one arm, with 95% intervals."}]},
